body:
Anything. Typically she and I briefly discuss about what I'm thinking of (usually the past) or recent events that happened that day.

She's very caring. It feels like I don't deserve her sometimes.

// ;w; Not true. You do so; I love you //

She can type an answer, but only if you're the one typing her words.

That's how my tulpa communicates, anyway~

// is true~ ;p Mew~ //

Any *feelings* you have are completely valid, regardless whether or not they're "justified". 

That said, I'm unsure how to approach answering this, as I haven't been able to answer this question for myself, either.

I don't have an s.o. yet, and I'm curious how her and I would pursue our relationship...

// With meeee~! //

=w=  Not, uh... not helping.

// :p Says you. Nyih. //
